    "three level-5 pets, so the battle is won within the 20 commands. Timber Wolf fought: a level-1 win is worth",
    "coa_pet_xp's 50 XP at 20% (four levels below), 10 XP toward level 5's 4 x 70 = 280. Both stand-ins appear",
    "while the battle runs and are removed after it."
